1+2&=3,\\ 1+3&=4,\\ 1+4&=5,\\ 1+5&=6,\\ 2+3&=5,\\ 2+4&=6,\\ 2+5&=7,\\ 3+4&=7,\\ 3+5&=8,\\ 4+5&=9.
\end{align*}The sum of the sums on the right-hand side is $55$.  As the 10 sums are equally likely, the expected value is numbers.\end{think} <answer> $55/10=5.5$ </answer>

